flowchart TD
  A[Workflow command] --> B{Valid transition?}
  B -- No --> X[Reject and audit]
  B -- Yes --> C[Claim lease and fencing token]
  C --> D[Execute idempotent side effect]
  D --> E{Outcome known?}
  E -- No --> R[Reconcile by stable operation key]
  R --> D
  E -- Yes --> F[Append event and checkpoint atomically]
  F --> G{Approval required?}
  G -- Yes --> H[Persist human interrupt]
  H --> I{Authorized and current?}
  I -- No --> X
  I -- Yes --> J[Resume workflow]
  G -- No --> J
  J --> K{More work?}
  K -- Yes --> C
  K -- No --> L[Completed]
  C --> S[Lease expires / worker crashes]
  S --> C
